<response><item key="0"><transcript-id>1413</transcript-id><title>PM 107/1966 – Itinerary for US Presidential Visit</title><prime-minister>Holt, Harold</prime-minister><period-of-service>19660126 - 19671219</period-of-service><field_date>12/10/1966</field_date><release-type>Media Release</release-type><document>https://pmtranscripts.pmc.gov.au/sites/default/files/original/00001413.pdf</document><subjects></subjects><content><![CDATA[<p style="margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:10px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Statement by the Prime Minister, Mr. Harold Holt</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The itinerary for the visit to Australia by President Johnson from the 20th 23rd of October has now been drawn up.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The programme, arranged by the Commonwealth Government and American authorities n consultation with the relevant States, has been approved by the White House. The variety in the itinerary will give the President and Mrs. Johnson some contact with distinctive features of the Australian scene and way of life.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">In particular, I am very glad that it has been possible to devise a programme that, within the limited time available, will enable large numbers of Australians to see the President. There will be official drives through the streets of Melbourne, Sydney and Brisbane, as well as Canberra. </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">An adjustment to the President's initial plans means that he will now be in Australia for an additional night, the 22nd. The original arrangement provided for departure from Australia late on the night of Saturday, 22nd October, but this has now been changed in favour of departure on Sunday morning.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">When this change was made, it was contemplated that the President would spend Saturday night in Canberra and make an aircraft refuelling stop of about 45 minutes in Brisbane, but it is now provided that he will fly to Brisbane on Saturday night and leave Australia from Brisbane on Sunday morning. This will not only give the people of Brisbane a better opportunity to see the President but will give him the benefit of a longer break of journey in the flight to Manila.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">The details of the Australian itinerary are as follows:-</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">THURSDAY, 20TH OCTOBER, 1966</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">6. 00 p. m. Ceremonial arrival at RAAF, Fairbairn<br>Proceed to Government House, arriving at 6. 50 pm.<br><br>Later &nbsp;Leave for Hotel Rex at Canberra arriving at about 7. 30 p. m.<br>Dine privately</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">FRIDAY, 21ST OCTOBER, 1966</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">10.00am. The President leaves the Hotel Rex at Canberra for wreath laying at Australian War Memorial</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Later Leaves for Parliament House via Australian/ American Memorial</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">10.30 am. Arrives at Parliament House for call on the Prime Minister of Australia<br>Discussion with Ministers to follow</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px; text-align:start"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="outline:0px"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-variant-numeric:inherit"><span style="font-variant-east-asian:inherit"><span style="font-stretch:inherit"><span style="line-height:inherit"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">NOTE: During the morning, Mrs. Johnson will undertake a separate programme which is not yet final.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">12. 15pm. The President and Mrs. Johnson attend a Parliamentary Luncheon at Parliament House at which the President will address invited guests</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">3. 00 pm. Take-off for Melbourne from RAAF Fairbairn</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">3. 45 pm. Arrive at Essendon Airport and drive through City of&nbsp;Melbourne</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Later Attend a joint Commonwealth/ State Reception<br><br>7.45 pm Take-off for Canberra from Essendon Airport<br><br>8,45pm Arrive at RAAF Fairbairn and proceed to Hotel Rex at Canberra</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><strong><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">22ND OCTOBER, 1966</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">Morning The President receives the Leader of Her Majesty's Opposition at the Hotel Rex at Canberra</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">10.30am Take-off for Sydney from RAAF Fairbairn </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">11.00am Arrive at Sydney Airport and drive through City of Sydney<br>Attend a joint Commonwealth/ State Reception and later&nbsp;leave for launch trip on harbour</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">3.00pm Take-off for Canberra from Sydney Airport</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">3.30pm Arrive at RAAF Fairbairn and proceed to Lanyon Station for a barbecue given by the Ambassador of the United States of America and Mrs. Clark</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">6.00pm Leave for RAAF Fairbairn<br>Arrive Ceremonial farewell<br><br>7.00pm Take-off for Brisbane</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">8.15pm Arrive at Brisbane Airport and proceed to Lennon's Hotel<br>Evening free<br><br><strong>SUNDAY, 23RD OCTOBER, 1966.</strong><br><br>9. 00 a m. Leave for Brisbane Airport<br>Arrive </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">10.00am Take-off for Manila</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">NOTE There could be some slight time changes when flying<br>times between cities have been rechecked.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="background:white"><span style="vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif"><span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">CANBERRA, 12th October, 1966.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:11px">&nbsp;</p>
]]></content></item></response>
